WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.302
Roxy called to her friends.

2
00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:06.333
They were farther up the trail.

3
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:08.083
"I'll be back in a minute!

4
00:00:08.084 --> 00:00:11.401
I still can't find my water bottle!"

5
00:00:11.402 --> 00:00:14.820
"Wait!" Terrell called back. "We can help—"

6
00:00:14.821 --> 00:00:19.652
Before Terrell could finish, Roxy ran off.

7
00:00:19.653 --> 00:00:23.672
A moment later she shot through the sky.

8
00:00:23.673 --> 00:00:28.165
"Whoa!" Mara cried. "Rocket Girl!"

9
00:00:28.166 --> 00:00:29.926
Terrell shook his head.

10
00:00:29.927 --> 00:00:35.662
"Roxy is never around when we see Rocket Girl."

11
00:00:35.663 --> 00:00:38.099
Roxy arrived at True Savings Bank.

12
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.063
Police cars were parked in front.

13
00:00:41.064 --> 00:00:45.811
Inside, Detective Smith was standing behind the counter.

14
00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.267
"Hello, sir," Roxy said.

15
00:00:48.268 --> 00:00:50.908
"I'd like to open a bank account."

16
00:00:50.909 --> 00:00:53.039
Detective Smith frowned.

17
00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.321
"Very funny, Rocket Girl.

18
00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:57.300
But we have a crime to solve.

19
00:00:57.301 --> 00:00:59.814
This bank was robbed."

20
00:00:59.815 --> 00:01:04.563
"I know," Roxy said. "Do you know who the robber is?"

21
00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.779
Detective Smith shook his head.

22
00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.913
"I just got here a moment ago.

23
00:01:08.914 --> 00:01:11.759
I'm looking for clues."

24
00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:14.240
"It wasn't just one robber."

25
00:01:14.241 --> 00:01:17.081
A security guard stomped over.

26
00:01:17.082 --> 00:01:19.419
"There was a whole group of them.

27
00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:23.644
They were horrible—dirty and smelly and mean!"

28
00:01:23.645 --> 00:01:26.798
Detective Smith took his small notebook from his pocket.

29
00:01:26.799 --> 00:01:29.527
"Can you describe what they looked like?"

30
00:01:29.528 --> 00:01:32.836
The security guard nodded.

31
00:01:32.837 --> 00:01:37.225
"The boss wore a large hat and has a hook for a hand.

32
00:01:37.226 --> 00:01:39.882
A parrot was sitting on her shoulder.

33
00:01:39.883 --> 00:01:43.134
It kept saying 'Yo-ho-ho!'"

34
00:01:43.135 --> 00:01:47.500
Detective Smith raised an eyebrow. "Yo-ho-ho?"

35
00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:53.554
"That's right," the security guard said. "Yo-ho-ho."

36
00:01:53.555 --> 00:01:57.372
"What did the other robbers look like?" Roxy asked.

37
00:01:57.373 --> 00:01:59.894
The security guard rubbed his chin.

38
00:01:59.895 --> 00:02:02.751
"There were three other robbers.

39
00:02:02.752 --> 00:02:05.863
One had a long beard and an eye patch.

40
00:02:05.864 --> 00:02:08.526
The other two wore bandannas.

41
00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:11.688
One guy had a wooden leg."

42
00:02:11.689 --> 00:02:15.162
"It sounds like they're pirates!" Roxy said.

43
00:02:15.163 --> 00:02:17.709
Detective Smith scratched his head.

44
00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:20.926
"There aren't any pirates in Metro City.

45
00:02:20.927 --> 00:02:23.663
They must be from out of town."

46
00:02:23.664 --> 00:02:28.381
"We have to stop them before they rob another bank," Roxy said.

47
00:02:28.382 --> 00:02:31.988
Just then Detective Smith's phone beeped.

48
00:02:31.989 --> 00:02:37.813
"Hello? Oh no! Okay, we'll hurry over there right now!"

49
00:02:37.814 --> 00:02:40.068
"What's going on?" Roxy asked.

50
00:02:40.069 --> 00:02:43.109
"Are the pirates robbing another bank?"

51
00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:45.424
"Nope," Detective Smith said.

52
00:02:45.425 --> 00:02:49.307
"They're eating lunch."

53
00:02:49.308 --> 00:02:52.271
"Huh?" Roxy was confused.

54
00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:54.458
"The pirates are at The Wharf.

55
00:02:54.459 --> 00:02:58.925
That's the city's fanciest seafood restaurant," Detective Smith said.

56
00:02:58.926 --> 00:03:01.781
"The owner said they're causing lots of trouble.

57
00:03:01.782 --> 00:03:06.875
They are making a mess, breaking things, and scaring the other customers."

58
00:03:06.876 --> 00:03:10.662
Roxy folded her arms. "We have to catch them!"

59
00:03:10.663 --> 00:03:13.289
Detective Smith put away his phone.

60
00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:19.645
"Okay, Rocket Girl. Let's—Rocket Girl?"

